# The tools on top of the app. **Edit this file, then run `make lock`** -- see
# requirements.in. `-c requirements.txt` holds every package both sets share
# to the version the runtime lock chose, so the suite tests exactly what a
# deployment runs.
-r requirements.in
-c requirements.txt
# The updater's own dependencies (sigstore), so the suite runs its
# verification tests; held to requirements-updater.txt the same way.
-r requirements-updater.in
-c requirements-updater.txt
